                  %mo ⫽
                  %mi G
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Lambda (X \sslash G)
            are the “inert” actions, consisting of elements of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stabilizer+subgroups"} stabilizer subgroups
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
