          %h3#for_internal_groupoids For internal groupoids
          %p
            The same construction can be performed for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/groupoid+objects"} groupoid objects
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internalization"} internal
            to any
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finitely+complete+category"} finitely complete category
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/limits"} limits
            exist.
          %h3#for_orbifolds For orbifolds
          %p
            If a (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differentiable+stack"}> differential
            ,
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+stack"} topological
            or
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+stack"} algebraic
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orbifold"} orbifold
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/inertia+stack"} inertia stack
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orbifold"} orbifold
            corresponds to a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Morita+equivalence"} Morita equivalence
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalence+class"} class
            of a proper
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%C3%A9tale+groupoid"} étale groupoid
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Λ
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Lambda G
            of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G
            is the Morita equivalence class of the (proper étale)
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action+groupoid"} action groupoid
            for the
