              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohesion"} cohesion
              of the loops leads to a distinction between various in-equivalent notions of “
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/free+loop+spaces"}> free loop spaces
              ” of orbifolds:
            %p Let:
            %ul
              %li
