                    %mi ʃ
                    %mi 𝒜
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{A} \xrightarrow{ \eta_{\mathcal{A}}} &amp;#643; \mathcal{A}
              induces a canonical comparison morphism between the two
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
