                        %mo ≔
                        %mi G
                        %msub
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                          %mi ad
                        %mi G
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} ConjCl(G) \coloneqq G /_{ad} G
                  is the set of
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/conjugacy+classes"} conjugacy classes
