            %p
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/groupoid+convolution+algebra"} groupoid convolution algebra
              of the inertia groupoid of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/delooping+groupoid"} delooping groupoid
