                    \\;\simeq\;
                    [S,\overline{W}G]_\bullet
                    \\,.
            %p
          .proof
            %h6 Proof
            %p
              We claim that the isomorphism is given by sending, for each
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
